* Morpho Vault V1 (MetaMorpho)
** Versions
*** v1.0: MetaMorpho
*** v1.1: MetaMorphoV1_1
*** Immutable, one factory each
** Roles
*** Owner: fee, curator, allocators
*** Curator: supply caps
*** Allocators: queues, reallocate
*** Guardian: revoke only
** Timelock
*** One value, 1 day to 2 weeks
*** Cap increase, forced removal
*** Timelock decrease, guardian change
*** Anyone accepts after delay
** Markets
*** submitCap / acceptCap
*** Max 30 markets
*** Normal or forced removal
*** Idle market convention
left side
** Queues
*** Supply queue: deposits up to caps
*** Withdraw queue: liquidity, totalAssets
*** reallocate: withdrawn = supplied
** Accounting
*** Sum of Blue supply
*** Performance fee <= 50%
*** Real max* functions
** Bad debt
*** v1.0: share price drops
*** v1.1: lostAssets, price unchanged
*** v1.1: last holders bear the loss
** Vault V2 changes
*** Adapters, id-based caps
*** Per-function timelocks, abdicate
*** Sentinels, gates, maxRate
*** In-kind redemption
@endmindmap
